# Run artifacts - regenerate with `python -m sprite_extractor`.
# NOTE: "output/" is intentionally NOT globbed here - it collides with the
# `output/` source package (naming.py, exporter.py, metadata.py). A run's
# `--output` target should be pointed outside this tree (or listed
# explicitly below if it must live under it).
/debug/
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
